<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia building approvals fall in Sept.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia building approvals fall in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian dwelling unit building approvals fell a seasonally-adjusted 8.6 percent in September to 9,861 from 10,791 in August, compared with 10,901 in September 1995, the Australian Bureau of Statistics said.</p>
<p>Economists' median forecasts had been for building approvals to be flat in September.</p>
</text>
